				{
					"type": "text",
					"value": "If the navigation to a new route is fast, users may see an unnecessary flash of the hint. One way to improve the user experience and only show the hint when the navigation takes time to complete is to add an initial animation delay (e.g. 100ms) and start the animation as invisible (e.g. "
